                Blocks(Paragraph(Text("Counts all five actual finite classes uniformly in m, including an empty same-branch class at m=1. Exact source statement: theorem placement_counts (m : \u2115) :     (placementsCC m).card = 1 \u2227     (placementsCPsame m).card = 2*m \u2227     (placementsCPopp m).card = 2*m \u2227     (placementsPPsame m).card = m*(m-1) \u2227     (placementsPPopp m).card = m^2."))), DescribeRole.Theorem),
